s":[{"author":{"id":1010144,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/69/e0/fd4e4c19.jpg","nickname":"胡忠想","note":"","ucode":"0792605FC265B4","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":427685,"discussion_content":"java版本motan是这么实现的","content_length":17,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1540956030,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":32268,"user_name":"blackcat","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1002452,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2A677908E5A75D","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/4b/d4/d41c6b35.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1539506888,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"1、f5一般用在四层负载，软负载一般用在七层负载\n2、f5性能和功能都很强大，但是设备价格昂贵。软负载成本低，而且可以横向扩展，功能可定制化开发，更加灵活。","like_count":30},{"had_liked":false,"id":31629,"user_name":"正是那朵玫瑰","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1048261,"ip_address":"","ucode":"73D630B654573F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/fe/c5/3467cf94.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1539249285,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":5,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"老师有几个疑问？\n最少活跃连接算法：客户端是怎么知道提供者有多少连接呢？\n自适应最优选择算法：性能好坏是根据提供的响应时间抽样统计吗？还是要提供者提供相应的接口给客户端调用来同统计？","like_count":11,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1735152,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/79/f0/19c6ae1c.jpg","nickname":"Geek_7324de","note":"","ucode":"B1C2CB60D75FB5","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":300036,"discussion_content":"最少活跃度连接算法，是在客户端保存了和提供者之间的连接数，服务开始的时候连接数加1，服务响应时节点数减1，是客户端自己维护的。","content_length":63,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1597916124,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":2224894,"avatar":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83epzialibpA6iaiaSyicziawiciauBJUfqVicFp8NPXUZKwAic057no97ljkrwhAB42InR2Y94Fq6rVSy3fhCUMA/132","nickname":"Geek_7e139d","note":"","ucode":"F233E16D5479EA","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1735152,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/79/f0/19c6ae1c.jpg","nickname":"Geek_7324de","note":"","ucode":"B1C2CB60D75FB5","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":330069,"discussion_content":"这个维护的连接数一般以什么为载体保存","content_length":18,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1606524815,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":300036,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":330069,"extra":""}]},{"author":{"id":1457544,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/3d/88/6d820abc.jpg","nickname":"lucas","note":"","ucode":"D3F975915E92C3","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":655101,"discussion_content":"2. **自适应最优选择算法性能评估方式**\n   - **基于响应时间抽样统计**\n     - 可以通过在客户端对提供者的响应时间进行抽样统计来评估性能。客户端可以发送一系列的探测请求到不同的提供者，记录每个请求的响应时间。例如，客户端可以每隔一段时间（如10秒）向各个提供者发送一个简单的“心跳”请求，记录从发送请求到收到响应的时间。通过收集足够多的样本（比如收集100个响应时间样本），就可以计算出平均响应时间、响应时间的标准差等统计指标。根据这些统计指标来判断提供者的性能。如果一个提供者的平均响应时间较短且标准差较小，说明其性能比较稳定和良好。\n   - **通过提供者接口统计**\n     - 有些情况下，提供者会提供专门的性能统计接口供客户端调用。例如，一个Web服务提供者可能会提供一个类似于“/performance - stats”的接口，客户端可以通过调用这个接口获取提供者内部的性能数据。这些数据可能包括服务器的CPU利用率、内存使用情况、当前正在处理的请求数量等。通过这些详细的数据，客户端可以更全面地评估提供者的性能。而且这种方式可以让客户端获得一些无法通过简单的响应时间抽样得到的信息，比如服务器的资源使用情况是否接近极限等。同时，这种方式也需要提供者和客户端在接口设计和调用规范上达成一致，以确保数据的准确性和有效性。","content_length":577,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1734144299,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1457544,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/3d/88/6d820abc.jpg","nickname":"lucas","note":"","ucode":"D3F975915E92C3","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":655100,"discussion_content":"1. **最少活跃连接算法中客户端了解提供者连接数的方式**\n   - 在最少活跃连接算法中，客户端通常需要服务器（提供者）来协助提供连接相关的信息。一种常见的方式是通过服务器端的负载均衡器来实现。负载均衡器可以对后端服务器（提供者）的连接情况进行跟踪和统计。\n   - 例如，在基于HTTP的服务中，像Nginx这样的负载均衡器可以维护每个后端服务器的连接状态信息。它可以通过诸如服务器状态模块来收集数据，这些模块会记录每个后端服务器当前正在处理的连接数量等信息。\n   - 另一种方式是通过专门的服务发现和管理机制。一些分布式系统会有一个服务注册中心，提供者在启动时会向注册中心注册自己的服务信息，包括能够处理的最大连接数、当前活跃连接数等。客户端在请求服务时，可以从注册中心获取这些信息，从而了解每个提供者的连接情况。\n   - 还有些系统会使用自定义的协议来传递连接信息。例如，在某些微服务架构中，服务之间可能会通过消息队列或者自定义的RPC（远程过程调用）协议来通信。在这些协议中，可以定义专门的消息头或者消息体字段来传递提供者的连接状态信息，如活跃连接数等。\n","content_length":486,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1734144295,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1110437,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f1/a5/6cc9f728.jpg","nickname":"秋天的透明雨🌧️","note":"","ucode":"9363B49BFA6C14","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":285093,"discussion_content":"对自适应最优选择算法存在同样的疑问，如何获取客户端同每个服务节点之间调用的平均性能统计？","content_length":44,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1592737738,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":82061,"user_name":"Ellison","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1207457,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A2FB94D4F6A332","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/6c/a1/80d83f0a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1554111945,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"最少活跃连接之前老师说过，每一次来一个请求就会+1， 请求完返回就会-1，白学了，二楼","like_count":9,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1139413,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/62/d5/1f5c5ab6.jpg","nickname":"大大大熊myeh","note":"","ucode":"4832C2E7CEB151","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":281902,"discussion_content":"最少活跃连接，看的是请求量的数目，你一个请求来+1，结束-1，怎么计算请求量？\n应该只+1，请求结束不会-1的。这样才能体现连接数。","content_length":66,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1591838732,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1735152,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/79/f0/19c6ae1c.jpg","nickname":"Geek_7324de","note":"","ucode":"B1C2CB60D75FB5","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1139413,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/62/d5/1f5c5ab6.jpg","nickname":"大大大熊myeh","note":"","ucode":"4832C2E7CEB151","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":300037,"discussion_content":"...你这样的话，就算的是累计连接数，怎么能看出活跃连接数。。","content_length":31,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1597916208,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":281902,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":300037,"extra":""}]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":66553,"user_name":"木木木","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1240679,"ip_address":"","ucode":"5EBC11AB704EF2","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/ee/67/d6d9499e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1549958512,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"F5应用在网络的三层（网络层），可通过ip重写来实现负载均衡，优势是应用逻辑无关性，性能超高。缺点就是贵，而且没法订制，因为对传输层和应用层都不了解，没法根据特定应用比如url做负载均衡。\n软负载一般工作在四层或七层，haproxy或niginx，优势是可定制性强，成本低。","like_count":5},{"had_liked":false,"id":30816,"user_name":"lwt","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1063356,"ip_address":"","ucode":"856CFF234B6FE4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/39/bc/5a58c429.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1539004356,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"自适应最优算法中，是通过哪些指标去衡量服务提供者当前的性能的呢？","like_count":4},{"had_liked":false,"id":103935,"user_name":"钱","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1009652,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2C92A243A463D4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/67/f4/9a1feb59.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1560568479,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"原理讲的通俗易懂，赞👍，具体咋实现自己玩吧!\n软硬件的负载均衡都没直接实现过，推测硬件性能更好价格更高比较硬不灵活。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":400299,"user_name":"ifelse","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2550743,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"D0565908C99695","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/eb/d7/90391376.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1747284644,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":3,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"学习打卡","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":390516,"user_name":"6点无痛早起学习的和尚","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1703256,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"33A8A1CDA103F9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/fd/58/1af629c7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1715557666,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":2,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"其实这个原理感觉有点类似于操作系统的寻址方法","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":315025,"user_name":"俯瞰风景.","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1044166,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A6DB68B7B84AEE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/ee/c6/bebcbcf0.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1633663500,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"负载均衡的目的是UI最大化地利用现有资源，达成最优的性能。所以要综合考虑实际业务场景中的具体情况：比如硬件数量、每台硬件的配置。\n\n如果数量少，配置类似，就适合随机和轮询算法。\n如果数量多，配置不同，适合采用更加具备“自适应”特性的算法，比如加权轮询和自适应最优选择算法。\n如果要保证同一来源的请求都映射到同一个节点上，只能选择一致性哈希算法。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":253651,"user_name":"coder","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1656956,"ip_address":"","ucode":"3A0940EBF94577","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/48/7c/2aaf50e5.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1602819043,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"啥叫长尾请求啊","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":173487,"user_name":"Ricky Gu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1345636,"ip_address":"","ucode":"EDCD7D7DA60E38","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/88/64/39501fbe.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1579573844,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"自适应算法是根据返回延迟来调整请求的数量，有没有可能动态调整链接数量呢？就是活跃链接数量","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":99228,"user_name":"亚林","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1018972,"ip_address":"","ucode":"4A5A6D24314B79","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8c/5c/3f164f66.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1559179636,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"软负载便宜，F5太贵","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":77276,"user_name":"妥协","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1249656,"ip_address":"","ucode":"7201DFE9C12669","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/11/78/4f0cd172.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1552900650,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"最小活跃链接算法是依赖，客户端和服务端通过短链接通信吧。但是短链接的要频繁的建立和断开链接，为何不用长链接?","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":53643,"user_name":"笑忘日月星辰","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1093857,"ip_address":"","ucode":"79B6F429C78D8B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/b0/e1/3aeb2d2d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1545704541,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100014401,"comment_content":"加权轮询例子中，如果要尽可能保证生产的序列的均匀，序列设置为{a、a、b、c、b、a},在第7次访问开始，又从a开始，这样第6，7，8三次访问的节点都是a,也会造成节点访问失衡吧，如果设计为{a、b、a、b、a、c},更能保证序列的均匀吧，古月老师？\n\n\n\n","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":45047,"user_name":"常扬","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1207316,"ip_address":"","ucode":"F48F2C17E076E7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/6c/14/06535aa1.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1543541392,"is_pvip":false,"